# LeadForge AI — Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` (at the project root) and populate the values.  
**Never commit `.env` to version control.** The `.env.example` file is safe to commit.

## Application

APP_NAME="LeadForge AI"
APP_VERSION="0.1.0"
ENVIRONMENT=development   # development | staging | production
DEBUG=True
PORT=8000

## Backend Server

HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000","http://127.0.0.1:3000"]

## Database

# SQLite (local dev) or PostgreSQL (production / Supabase / Neon)
DATABASE_URL="sqlite:///./leadforge.db"
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql+asyncpg://user:password@localhost:5432/leadforge_ai"

DATABASE_POOL_SIZE=20
DATABASE_MAX_OVERFLOW=10

## Redis (ARQ background job queue + caching)

REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379/0"

## Security & Cryptography

# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
JWT_SECRET_KEY="replace_with_a_64_character_hex_random_secret"
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=1440

# Master encryption key for AES-256-GCM OAuth token vault
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
MASTER_ENCRYPTION_KEY="replace_with_a_64_character_hex_master_key"

## AI Gateway — OpenRouter (single unified LLM provider)

OPENROUTER_API_KEY="sk-or-v1-your-openrouter-key-here"
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL="https://openrouter.ai/api/v1"
OPENROUTER_SITE_URL="https://leadforge.agency.com"
OPENROUTER_SITE_NAME="LeadForge AI"

# Model routing (primary -> fallback)
OPENROUTER_TIER1_MODEL="deepseek/deepseek-chat"
OPENROUTER_TIER1_FALLBACK="google/gemini-flash-1.5"
OPENROUTER_TIER2_MODEL="deepseek/deepseek-chat"
OPENROUTER_TIER2_FALLBACK="openai/gpt-4o-mini"
OPENROUTER_TIER3_MODEL="anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet"
OPENROUTER_TIER3_FALLBACK="openai/gpt-4o-mini"

# Daily AI spend circuit breaker (USD)
DAILY_AI_BUDGET_USD=5.00

## Google Cloud Platform

# Google Places API (New) — business discovery
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY="AIzaSyYourGoogleCloudApiKeyHere"

# Google PageSpeed Insights API — website auditing
GOOGLE_PAGESPEED_API_KEY="AIzaSyYourGoogleCloudApiKeyHere"

## Google Workspace / Gmail OAuth 2.0 (outreach engine)

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com"
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET="GOCSPX-yourClientSecretHere"
GOOGLE_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI="http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/google/callback"

## Web Crawler & SSRF Safeguards

CRAWLER_USER_AGENT="LeadForgeBot/1.0 (+https://leadforge.agency.com/crawler; contact@agency.com)"
CRAWLER_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=10
CRAWLER_MAX_REDIRECTS=3
CRAWLER_MAX_BODY_BYTES=1048576
CRAWLER_CONCURRENCY_PER_DOMAIN=2

## Email Outreach & Compliance Defaults

DEFAULT_DAILY_SEND_LIMIT=35
SENDING_WINDOW_START_HOUR=10
SENDING_WINDOW_END_HOUR=17
MIN_SEND_DELAY_SECONDS=60
MAX_SEND_DELAY_SECONDS=180

# CAN-SPAM / DPDP footer address
AGENCY_NAME="Your Agency Name"
AGENCY_PHYSICAL_ADDRESS="Your Agency Address, City, State, Postal Code, Country"
AGENCY_CONTACT_EMAIL="outreach@youragency.com"

## Frontend (Next.js) — copy to frontend/.env.local

# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME="LeadForge AI"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8000/api/v1"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT="development"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_COUNTRY="India"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_CITY="Mumbai"
